        "body": "Cache cleanup only runs on success. If model inference raises, including under GPU memory pressure, control jumps to the refusal handler without emptying the cache, and the worker continues accepting requests. Put cleanup on the failure path too, while preserving the refusal response, to release cached allocations after each request.",
