        "body": "If model.encode raises, including under GPU memory pressure, execution jumps to the refusal handler without calling empty_cache, and the loop accepts another request. This does not release the cache after each request. Put Apple GPU cleanup on the inference failure path as well, using a finally block while preserving the refusal response.",
